        "created_at": "2012-05-22T22:27:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I recall at one point that Chris mentioned that the H mechanic was specifically intended to mean 3, 4 or 5.  I wonder which thread that was in.  Possibly the same thread where somebody pointed out that you could just have H equal whatever you want in order to adjust the difficulty to suit your needs.</p>",
